## PFS Kaplan-Meier Curves {#sec-pfs-km}

::: {.panel-tabset}

### Sample-Based


::: {.cell}

```{.r .cell-code}
km_data |>
  filter(fit_type == "posterior") |>
  plot_km(
    km_est_var = sample_pfs_km_est,
    obs_km_data = obs_km_data |>
      filter(fct_match(btype, "ub")) |>
      select(!quantiles) |>
      unnest(km_data)
  )
```

::: {.cell-output-display}
![Sample-based PFS Kaplan-Meier curves (posterior). Shaded bands show 50% and 90% credible intervals.](survival-analysis_files/figure-html/fig-pfs-km-sample-1.png){#fig-pfs-km-sample width=576}
:::
:::


